8]},{"nodeId":722140208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3601411906,"text":"#寝子から{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYSECOND|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLSECOND]}への魚肉。","nextNodeIds":[722140209]},{"nodeId":722140209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":2704795978,"text":"えっと…気持ちはありがたいが…やはり自分で何か食べ物を探してくるよ…","nextNodeIds":[722140210]},{"nodeId":722140210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":25764754,"text":"もう何日も連続で魚肉を食べてる、これ以上は無理だ…","nextNodeIds":[722140211]},{"nodeId":722140211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":1014473498,"text":"今のところ毎日、自分で食べ物を探してる。運が良ければ、ヤマガラやハトなんかを見つけることができる…","nextNodeIds":[722140212]},{"nodeId":722140212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":1697535530,"text":"はぁ、やっぱり獣肉が食べたいぜ…身が引き締まってて、ジューシーな獣肉…","nextNodeIds":[722140213]},{"nodeId":722140213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":3451755098,"text":"その…旅人…","nextNodeIds":[722140214]},{"nodeId":722140214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":1189494050,"text":"もしよかったら、獣肉を3つ…探してきてくれないか？","nextNodeIds":[722140215]},{"nodeId":722140215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":2082477282,"text":"俺は狩りが苦手でな…もう何日も試してるんだが獣肉を1つも手に入れてない…頼む！","nextNodeIds":[722140216,722140217]},{"nodeId":722140216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2608910402,"text":"分かった…","nextNodeIds":[722140220]},{"nodeId":722140220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":2458711426,"text":"それじゃ頼んだよ、獣肉を3つ持ってきてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722140217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1513065402,"text":"なんで一回鳴神島に戻らないの？","nextNodeIds":[722140218]},{"nodeId":722140218,"roleType":